<title>UK: GECC sets 100 million stg two-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 100 million stg two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    23.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.85     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT 1999 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
